https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Raytheon</link><description>Raytheon is a business unit of RTX Corporation and is a major U.S. defense contractor and industrial corporation with manufacturing concentrations in weapons, military, and commercial electronics.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 14:11:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>RTX Corporate - Raytheon</title><link>https://careers.rtx.com/global/en/corporate</link><description>Transformative Technologies at RTX involve leveraging 57,000 engineers, 60,000 patents, $7.5 billion in annual R&amp;D funding, and 10 forward-looking technology roadmaps. We invest in bold new concepts through our venture capital division and collaborate with over 85 U.S. universities.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 14:47:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>RTX Corporation - Wikipedia</title><link>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/RTX_Corporation</link><description>RTX manufactures aircraft engines, avionics, aerostructures, cybersecurity solutions, guided missiles, air defense systems, satellites, and drones. The company is a large military contractor, getting much of its revenue from the U.S. government.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:37:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>RTX Careers</title><link>https://careers.rtx.com/global/en/</link><description>Our businesses RTX is focused on accelerating ideas to solve some of the world’s toughest challenges. We do this by bringing together the world’s brightest, most innovative minds across aviation and defense within RTX Corporate, Collins Aerospace, Pratt &amp; Whitney and Raytheon.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:57:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Investor Relations | RTX</title><link>https://investors.rtx.com/</link><description>The Investor Relations website contains information about RTX's business for stockholders, potential investors, and financial analysts.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:30:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Search for Jobs - myworkdayjobs.com</title><link>https://globalhr.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/REC_RTX_Ext_Gateway/</link><description>RTX is an aerospace and defense company that provides advanced systems and services for commercial, military and government customers worldwide. It comprises three industry-leading businesses – Collins Aerospace, Pratt &amp; Whitney, and Raytheon.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 14:25:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>RTX Corporation (RTX) Stock Price, News, Quote &amp; History - Yahoo Finance</title><link>https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/RTX/</link><description>RTX Corporation, an aerospace and defense company, provides systems and services for commercial, military, and government customers worldwide. It operates through three segments: Collins Aerospace...</description><pubDate>Wed, 13 Aug 2025 23:57:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>